  "title": "Roasted Parmesan-Garlic Carrots",
  "description": "Roasting whole carrots gives the vegetable a full-bodied flavor to stand with garlic salt and Parmesan cheese in this easy side dish.",
  "authors": [
    "Pamela J Hagen-French"
